/target
# `crates/rift-lint-wasm` is its own workspace (see the root Cargo.toml's `exclude`), so it builds
# into its own `target/` that the anchored rule above does not reach. `pkg/` is wasm-pack's default
# output; the release lane writes to `web/public/lint` instead, but a local `wasm-pack build` does
# not.
/crates/rift-lint-wasm/target
/crates/rift-lint-wasm/pkg
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.orig
.DS_Store
# Local knowledge-graph tooling output (graphify)
/graphify-out
/.rift-ship
